# Secure Transport and Worker Identity Hardening slice: development PKI
# output (scripts/pki/*.sh, *.ps1) -- private keys, CSRs, and the CA's
# own private key all land under here. Never commit any of it, even
# though it is development-only material; see docs/development-pki.md.
certs/dev/
certs/dev*/

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Security Runtime Completion and Release Evidence slice: generated
# output from scripts/security-validation/run.py and
# scripts/generate_release_evidence.py (sanitized, but regenerable --
# never intended to be committed), plus the CLI worker's own local
# per-worker sequence-state files it writes to the current working
# directory when run outside Docker (see
# python/src/fl_platform/worker/configuration.py's
# sequence_state_path default).
artifacts/
.fl_worker_sequence_state.*.json
web/e2e-results/
